# KN-004: Enzyme loading affects the early peroxide-decomposition rate
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 catalase 0.000000000002mol
add v1 H2O2 0.01mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 catalase 0.000000000004mol
add v2 H2O2 0.01mol
wait 0.00001s
inspect
